[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Our New Neighbour]
[00:00.72]Lesson 93 | 第93课
[00:02.42]Our new neighbour | 我们的新邻居
[00:05.32]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.38]Why is Nigel a lucky man? | 为什么奈杰尔是个幸运的人？
[00:16.19]Nigel is our new next-door neighbour. | 奈杰尔是我们的新邻居。
[00:21.28]He's a pilot. | 他是一名飞行员。
[00:23.76]He was in the R.A.F. | 他曾服役于皇家空军。
[00:27.44]He will fly to New York next month. | 下个月他将飞往纽约。
[00:32.47]The month after next he'll fly to Tokyo. | 下下个月他将飞往东京。
[00:38.02]At the moment, he's in Madrid. | 此刻，他在马德里。
[00:41.85]He flew to Spain a week ago. | 一周前他飞往西班牙。
[00:46.24]He'll return to London the week after next. | 下下周他将返回伦敦。
[00:51.52]He's only forty-one years old, | 他只有四十一岁，
[00:55.60]and he has already been to nearly every country in the world. | 而且他已经去过世界上几乎每一个国家。
[01:02.76]Nigel is a very lucky man. | 奈杰尔是一个非常幸运的人。
[01:07.08]But his wife isn't very lucky. | 但是他的妻子却不那么幸运。
[01:10.32]She usually stays at home! | 她通常待在家里！